Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.35,0:00:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真白啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.46,0:00:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会马上做完这边的工作 好想你哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那软绵绵的 像棉花糖一样的白云 真白啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别... 别说了 爸爸真是的 别再这样子了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经不是小孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过得还好吗？没有寂寞吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:31.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题 有奶奶在 而且我还交到了新朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 等下次回去 要跟我们介绍哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再跟你视频了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:40.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 你们工作也要加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-好的 再见！ -嗯 再见！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:48.93,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呜呜！呜呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:54.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖 要喝牛奶吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:57.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:58.67,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:01:00.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还是要换尿布了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:02.06,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:04.71,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,空... 空...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.87,0:01:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 难道是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:08.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学你懂她想要什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是想见爸爸妈妈了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:16.79,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小... 空...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:18.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:24.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 可问题是 现在都不知道要怎么回蓝天大地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:24.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1470,970)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 也是啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.86,0:01:31.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少能够让她见到爸爸妈妈的样子...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有方法可以让她见到父母
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:38.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}-诶？      {\r}-诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个 就可以与蓝天大地取得联络
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:46.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}-诶!?      {\r}-诶!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}嘤嘤啜泣想家家！小空不要哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是幻镜平板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirror Pad
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.87,0:03:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够映照出心里在想的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能与娃娃身处蓝天大地的父母通话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:46.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 这边世界也有很好用的工具啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.23,0:03:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能！怎么可能有这种东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶 你究竟是哪来的世外高人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:52.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是蓝天人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.03,0:03:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:04:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊 奶奶是蓝天人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝！蓝天人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:09.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 你当真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 我是蓝天大地的一位博学家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.67,0:04:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在50年前 来到这边世界做调研的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说笑的...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然跟你们说这些 一下子很难接受的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 最近发生的都不是在做梦 能够相信我说的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:40.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 你该不会知道送我和小空回蓝天大地的方法吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:44.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 不过还需要一点时间做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就放心交给我来办吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.65,0:04:49.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 十分感谢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 现在你们...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.55,0:04:58.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,为了安慰寂寞的小空 要马上与蓝天大地取得联络 没错吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信号要传播到蓝天大地 需要大量的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能量源就是这种宝石
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:10.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空石！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:10.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这边世界也有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空石是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:18.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是在蓝天大地使用的一种矿物 能为各种用途提供动力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都没有见到过 不是轻易就能找到的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.75,0:05:27.51,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:30.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要找到天空石 让小空见到爸爸妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:39.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学！我跟你想到一起去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:41.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是天涯海角 都要去闯一闯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去哪里才能找到？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼 我们家后山应该就有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-就有的吗   {\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}-就有的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后... 后山吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:54.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,出乎意料的近啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:06:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 你的幻镜笔 会指引出宝石所在的方位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:06:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(735,970)}Mirage Pen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:05.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,既然已经有方向了 我们马上出发吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:06.84,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊呀...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:09.71,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:11.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也要一起去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们一起去外面逛逛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 那我去做一下准备
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:19.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就给小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那个的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:23.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,吊床穿戴完成！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 由由阿姨！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.27,0:06:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个应该会帮到你们大忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:35.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这还是来到这边世界 第一次外出呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:36.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.11,0:06:39.06,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,空空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们记住了 要是遇到什么问题 就马上回家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:47.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！我们走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:49.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:55.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吓我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶居然是蓝天人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.37,0:07:04.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那么真白同学也有一点蓝天人的血统吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从生物学上来讲 是的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:08.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,果然...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.62,0:07:12.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 就像由由阿姨说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:16.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的相遇 可能真的是命运
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:21.90,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,诶诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:23.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！乖一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:24.98,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:30.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,希望小空能打起精神来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.75,0:07:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 给你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.81,0:07:36.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是蓬松的(蒲公英)棉絮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:40.76,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不喜欢吗？那么这样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:49.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:52.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:58.41,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！小空！小空！小空！小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:07:59.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学懂得真多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:02.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,逗小空的手法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.95,0:08:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:07.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 照顾小宝宝的时候 最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:10.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是能判断出 小宝宝心里的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:15.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就像刚才 能够给小空喜欢的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:19.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是因为真白同学有着温柔的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有... 真的有吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.49,0:08:24.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 我也找点什么给小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:25.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这... 这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.85,0:08:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下！那个蘑菇是有毒的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.83,0:08:36.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山里是会有危险的植物的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是熟悉的东西 不能贸然接触
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:46.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是 真是危险啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家以后 给你看家里的图鉴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.23,0:08:53.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:56.75,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呜 呜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:08:57.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.93,0:09:02.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是肚子饿了吧 刚才都没有喝牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:13.53,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,噗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:14.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,吃饱了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:17.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:20.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,来 乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:21.14,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,噗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.73,0:09:25.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吃吧 我给小晴准备了面包
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:27.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:34.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！很柔软！非常好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.54,0:09:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 我有点担心能不能烤好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:44.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！这是真白同学烤的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:47.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还会做面包 太厉害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,而且味道都是职业级的水准了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:52.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:54.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？难道说这个面包
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是云彩的形状吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.00,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我试着以蓝天大地为印象
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我并不知道... 蓝天大地是个怎么样的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就取名为云面包！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:11.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,云面包 嘻嘻嘻！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:15.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 这是云面包 软绵绵的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:17.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,软绵绵！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:22.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空... 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:24.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-太好了！  {\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}-太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:28.48,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空 小空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶指的 应该就是这条小溪...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:43.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:45.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（幻镜笔提示音）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:47.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,笔发光了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,附近就有天空石了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:54.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 寻宝的时间开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在这一边吗？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:01.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！那个是？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:06.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好... 好厉害！这究竟是谁 又出于什么目的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 的确是很厉害...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:11.63,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:12.96,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,阿嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:14.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:17.08,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该不会在这里面？我说笑的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:26.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.23,0:11:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:33.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,试试看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴你来真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.67,0:11:40.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 有种好厉害的感觉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地自古相传的蓝天神拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:02.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.21,0:12:06.89,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.35,0:12:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的劈开了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！化石？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,得教！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}押忍！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:21.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 虽然是发现了宝贝...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.77,0:12:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没有产生什么反应
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟天空石没有关系呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:32.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,找不到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:34.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:35.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好强的光...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:39.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！那边的是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:45.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下就能跟蓝天大地通话了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:51.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:12:56.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:13:00.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！你们吓到我了 石塔都倒掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.91,0:13:02.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要怎么赔我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.98,0:13:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:05.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:06.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤兔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:10.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,老子叫！卡！疤！痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:12.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,都几次了 该记住了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.28,0:13:14.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.47,0:13:16.10,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:20.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,想要的东西 居然自己送上门来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:22.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好运！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:26.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,把那个小娃娃交给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不给！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:33.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也很不得已啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.70,0:13:36.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:47.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:51.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！去抓到小娃娃！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:55.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 你们去躲起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:13:58.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:04.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:11.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:11.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天籁接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:21.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海阔天空变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:23.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:23.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:33.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,闪耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:33.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:41.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飞奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:41.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:49.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,畅快跃起！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:49.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:12.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,广阔无限的蓝天！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:14.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:14.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:21.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽 给我上！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:23.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:28.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:35.49,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要怕 Cure Sky会保护我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:41.21,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:49.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,待在地面很危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！好强的力气！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:15:59.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:02.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.18,0:16:04.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:05.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:08.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:12.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:14.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,混账！你在搞什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:17.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:21.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这种东西是打不到我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:31.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,危险！真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.17,0:16:38.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.61,0:16:44.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（脚步声）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:45.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:50.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！乱乱乱乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:53.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.79,0:16:54.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:58.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,混账！快点收拾掉她！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:16:59.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:01.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:02.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.57,0:17:05.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:06.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:11.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:17.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:17.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:20.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:24.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.80,0:17:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:38.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是叫你收拾掉乱暴兽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:41.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话 就用这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:43.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.41,0:17:52.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃 好吃 这下我就气力炸裂了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.16,0:17:54.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.52,0:17:57.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？你难道要打第2轮？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:18:00.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！暗塌谷...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:01.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（肚子叫了）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:02.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:07.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的！在山里不能随便采摘和食用植物的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:08.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以的哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.97,0:18:10.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,坏宝宝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:13.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,给我记住！卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:26.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么... 因为真白同学保护了小空
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:29.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我才可以放心去战斗的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:33.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:34.94,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:42.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们快点回去 把天空石交给由由阿姨！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:48.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你了 由由阿姨！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该可以接通了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:09.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？是谁打来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.89,0:19:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通信恢复了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:13.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空看到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:16.54,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.32,0:19:20.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.42,0:19:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.33,0:19:22.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:25.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,和我给她取的名字是一样的诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该惊讶的不是这个吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.11,0:19:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是公主诶 也就是说小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.12,0:19:33.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是蓝天大地的公主吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:35.24,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:38.93,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:46.70,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.13,0:19:49.98,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有受伤吧？肚子没饿着吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 看样子应该没事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空公主 你没事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最闪亮的小星星！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 见到了爸爸妈妈 是不是稍微安心了一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:22.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.74,0:20:27.24,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！空空！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.43,0:20:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.23,0:20:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到你很精神 我们就放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.57,0:20:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下 王妃殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在做好回到那边世界的准备之前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主就交给我们来照顾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.53,0:20:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地的大能耐传奇·名誉博学家·由由博士！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(775,970)}Hyper NengNai Legend
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:51.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-啊！   {\3c&HF348AE&\4c&H000000&}-小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.39,0:20:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通信就要切断了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:54.87,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.05,0:20:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空公主 就拜托给
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.95,0:20:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位照顾了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:00.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:05.48,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:23.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.56,0:21:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.87,0:21:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴啊 你没有想家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:37.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴应该也很想家人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:44.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有想要做的事 没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:45.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,而且...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:51.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 我的身边还有朋友嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.40,0:21:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.45,0:22:00.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.95,0:22:04.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（嬉笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:09.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H8A68FF&\4c&H865FEC&}今天是我  Cure Precious！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:09.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H8A68FF&\4c&H865FEC&\pos(1095,970)}{\fs50}珍奇愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:12.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H8A68FF&\4c&H865FEC&}大家来一起 美味微笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:12.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H8A68FF&\4c&H865FEC&\pos(1100,970)}{\fs50}Delicious Smile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.11,0:23:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空啊 你长大了 想要做什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.41,0:23:50.13,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.31,0:23:52.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要成为英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.72,0:23:54.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学想要做什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.97,0:23:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 我吗？我啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.01,0:23:59.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.01,0:23:59.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:03.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是英雄少女！Cure prism登场!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:03.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl　                 棱镜愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:49.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.49,0:01:55.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.29,0:02:00.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.63,0:02:08.35,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.55,0:02:13.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.77,0:02:17.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:19.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.23,0:02:23.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:28.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:30.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:34.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:38.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:42.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:42.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:44.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.42,0:02:44.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:49.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:54.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:59.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:04.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:07.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:15.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.02,0:22:29.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空万里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.69,0:22:34.28,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能实现梦想与心愿的蔚蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:37.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打开心中的麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.03,0:22:38.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.87,0:22:41.25,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.71,0:22:44.17,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.17,0:22:46.13,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能与你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.13,0:22:48.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打开心灵+门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:51.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已经激动到势不可挡!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.59,0:22:53.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.39,0:22:55.93,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:23:02.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}还是那条街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:08.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那里 这便是奇迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:10.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.36,0:23:15.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都过来！传开这韵律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.03,0:23:19.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牵起手 心连起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.28,0:23:25.37,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用温暖的关怀 培育出的勇气 是无穷无穷的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.46,0:23:29.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,积极的图标是标记
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.63,0:23:33.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！这海阔天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:37.50,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们展开翅膀 飞向蓝天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.50,0:23:38.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,连接起人与人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.89,0:23:41.60,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圆环！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
